/target
# Cargo.lock is NOT ignored here, deliberately (#446) — do not re-add it.
#
# Spike 0004 is frozen (iced FAILED the accessibility bar; the reference UI is Tauri 2), and
# every one of this crate's dependencies is optional, so the DEFAULT build resolves nothing.
# Neither fact is a reason to leave it unpinned: `--features gui` pulls the whole iced/winit/
# wgpu tree, and the person who runs that is by definition someone revisiting a decision, not
# someone auditing a dependency graph. The repo-wide rule is one line with no exceptions —
# every cargo tree commits its lockfile — which is worth more than the handful of trees an
# exception list would spare. See #445.
